      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{\\Gamma(1/3)}{3}=\\Gamma\\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right)$",
      "claim": "INT(e^(-x^3), 0, inf) == INT(x^(1/3)*e^(-x), 0, inf) ;; INT(e^(-x^3), 0, inf) == INT(x^(-2/3)*e^(-x), 0, inf)/3"
